    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "ARKit refers to its local coordinate space as “world” coordinate space, but this is different from geographic coordinates.",
      "ko": "ARKit은 로컬 좌표 공간을 “world” 좌표 공간이라고 부르지만, 이는 지리 좌표와 다릅니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ff1fa67758559c2f5b3095683049523a394b5f60cf2c6763417b08f639e876c8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "For more information on ARKit’s coordinate space, see [`setWorldOrigin(relativeTransform:)`](arsession/setworldorigin(relativetransform:).md).",
      "ko": "ARKit의 좌표 공간에 대한 자세한 내용은 [`setWorldOrigin(relativeTransform:)`](arsession/setworldorigin(relativetransform:).md)에서 확인합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d8ea2a11c0cc549e24b63bf98887cee4e3ced3e4398211c8fa7ce33402f0d8cf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "To succeed, this function requires an [`ARGeoTrackingConfiguration`](argeotrackingconfiguration.md) session with state equal to [`ARGeoTrackingStatus.State.localized`](argeotrackingstatus/state-swift.enum/localized.md).",
      "ko": "이 함수를 성공적으로 실행하려면 상태가 [`ARGeoTrackingStatus.State.localized`](argeotrackingstatus/state-swift.enum/localized.md)인 [`ARGeoTrackingConfiguration`](argeotrackingconfiguration.md) 세션이 필요합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8d2717e9884c84adff1af1cc8450b8fdfdb4d3a812be3c0cd762c00060ee5310",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
